{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_shining_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_shining_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"雨夜","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_shining_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"e16e14930e07d7a28885c55d3e7c59f0fd9d850157e72aaba5e6c67bc2906130","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"逃離赦罪師的閃靈帶著夜鶯避雨，屋主女兒和她們玩樂甚歡。閃靈擊殺了尾隨而來的刺客，雨停後帶著夜鶯離開，與臨光擦肩而過。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"誰在外面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你好，我們是路過的雇傭兵，外面雨太大了，想在這裡避一會雨，可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你們可以去村裡的旅館。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們一會還要趕路，只是借這裡暫時避一下雨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"除了你還有誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的同伴，她行動不太方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有惡意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡不歡迎魔族佬，出去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"一把長劍架在了她的脖子上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想說第二遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請至少……允許我的同伴在屋子裡休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"她怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和你一樣，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你是雇傭兵，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"只准在門邊待著，別到處亂晃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，有客人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"不關你的事，回房間去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了，麗茲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的運氣還不錯，找到了地方休息。再往前走一段路，就能離開維多利亞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要注意休息，好嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，我會的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大姐姐，需要毛巾嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"屋主遠遠看著女兒走向薩卡茲，不由自主地把手伸向了劍柄。\n但他所擔心的事，並沒有發生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"閃靈接過毛巾，幫夜鶯擦乾了頭髮，細心照料一番後，才脫下兜帽，開始擦拭自己那不斷滴水的長髮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒什麼。我只是在想要說什麼好……"},{"type":"narration","text":"啾啾。\n一隻藍色的小傢伙從夜鶯的口袋裡鑽了出來，落在了她的肩上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，是羽獸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以摸摸它嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜鶯抬起手，羽獸就一跳一跳地從她的肩膀來到了指尖上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我第一次見到這麼聽話的羽獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻~你好呀~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你從哪裡來呀？"},{"type":"narration","text":"羽獸鳴叫著，像是在回答女孩的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小羽獸小羽獸，想不想玩遊戲呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸為我做了很多玩具，但村裡的小朋友都不喜歡跟我玩……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遊戲……是什麼樣的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐你想玩嗎？！稍等一下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小女孩匆匆跑到了房間裡，像是在找東西。\n鼓搗一陣後，她拿出了一個小紙箱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這裡有很多好玩的，都是爸爸用木頭雕出來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最喜歡的是這個——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩在箱子裡翻找著什麼，不時拿出一兩根木塊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都散掉了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我幫忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要幫我把這樣的木塊都拿出來，然後三根一排橫橫豎豎壘起來就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"narration","text":"閃靈和女孩一起，從箱子裡翻找出木塊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐姐姐，你的角好漂亮啊，你是埃拉菲亞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我是薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，真的，沒有毛茸茸的耳朵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛我還在房間裡的時候，聽到姊姊說準備離開維多利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞不好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞不適合我們……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"閃靈拿起幾個剛從箱子裡找到的木塊，將它們一根一根堆疊在一起……\n沒疊上幾根，眼前的景色便模糊成了一團擁擠的色彩。\n她很久沒有待在這樣一個充滿善意的環境裡了，放鬆下來，睏意便一擁而上。\n思緒隨著光團在半空中不停地打轉……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"閃靈已經能夠看到出口的光亮了。\n而在她身後的陰影裡，堆滿了赦罪師衛兵的屍體。\n她沒有回頭，只是摸了摸綁在自己背上的夜鶯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜鶯還沒完全甦醒，她只是下意識地緊緊抱住閃靈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再忍耐一會，麗茲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們在那裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (C)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們走吧，離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (C)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我也不知道要去哪裡，麗茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (C)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這片大地或許沒有我們的容身之處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (C)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但至少……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (C)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會把你留在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"洞窟中的白晝一閃而過，在承重柱和岩石上留下了一道痕跡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在閃靈走出洞窟前，一隻藍色的羽獸早已迫不及待地飛向陽光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛的聲音是從這裡傳來的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們逃出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟著她們，你去給首領報信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洞口要塌了，快往後退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來、來不及了——！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哎呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"narration","text":"一聲驚呼將閃靈拉回了現實。\n女孩不小心碰倒了快要完成的木塔，木塊散落處都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不再多休息一下嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……這下得從頭再來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就再來一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也……可以幫忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，多一個人就多一份力量呢！"},{"type":"narration","text":"當三人重新將木塔堆起時，閃靈瞥了一眼屋子的主人。\n他坐在窗邊，手裡仍拿著那把長劍。\n與之相對，他的孩子正和她們坐在一起，將一些落下的木塊劃到了夜鶯面前，隨後繼續堆疊木塊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就差……最後一根……好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們就玩這個吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個遊戲很簡單的，先丟骰子，根據投出的數字抽出對應數字的木塊，疊在木塔最上面，誰把木塔弄倒，誰就輸啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先丟骰子看看從誰那裡開始……"},{"type":"narration","text":"骰子在三人眼前的地面上旋轉數次，為眾人分出了先後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從我先開始嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜鶯拿起骰子，然後任由它從手掌中滑落。\n她用不上太大的力，但好在，這是第一根木塊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來到你了，黑色的大姊姊。"},{"type":"narration","text":"閃靈接過骰子，拋出，落下。\n她看了眼數字，而後轉向了木塔。\n要取下一根木塊並不難，但隨著遊戲的進行，木塔本身會變得七零八落。\n而曾經的選擇與遭遇將層層累積，為未來施加更多的壓力。\n閃靈不喜歡這種感覺。\n但規則如此，她也不好拒絕。\n於是，又一根木塊疊上了塔頂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……你還好嗎，麗茲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……還好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡已經離實驗室有些距離了，他們不會再追得那麼緊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路還很長，休息一下，吃些東西吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還不餓……"},{"type":"narration","text":"閃靈翻開行囊，裡面只剩下一顆果子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乾糧還剩一點，你先吃些水果，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走過前面的橋應該會有村莊，我可以去買些食物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，先吃吧，皮已經削乾淨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g1_victoriavillage"},{"type":"narration","text":"一踏入村莊，她們周圍的驚訝聲與竊竊私語就沒停過，彷彿她們是闖入村莊的牙獸。\n閃靈卻不在乎這些，只要一買到乾糧，她們就會從這些維多利亞人面前消失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麵包攤主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，有什麼需要……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麵包攤主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"魔族佬？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，我想買些麵包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麵包攤主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"一邊去一邊去，我不賣麵包給魔族佬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"價錢都好說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麵包攤主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，要是收了你的錢，誰還願意吃我家麵包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麵包攤主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"走開走開，後面還有客人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打擾了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"閃靈的手按上了劍柄。\n晨曦一閃而過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麵包攤主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"噫！ ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麵包攤主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"殺、殺人啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請等——"},{"type":"narration","text":"閃靈很早就注意到了跟隨的赦罪師衛兵，她特意避開人多的地方，就是為了少生事端。\n但隨著麵包攤主大喊著跑向人群，越來越多的人圍了過來。\n“魔族佬殺人啦！！”\n“快去找騎警大人！！”\n“村長的兒子不是術師嗎，快讓他過來！！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"她只想買些果腹的口糧，最後卻只能狼狽地逃離村莊。\n背後的同伴在驚慌中緊緊抓著她的衣袍，不停地發抖。\n而在身後的更遠處，尖叫與咒罵聲持續了很久都沒能停歇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閃靈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"narration","text":"回過神來，她們已經坐在一起玩了許久。\n木塔的許多層都只剩下了一根木塊，可千瘡百孔的木塔仍保持著詭異的平衡。\n過不了多久，勝負就將揭曉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我幫忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做得到……讓我試試。"},{"type":"narration","text":"那根木塊被壓得很緊，夜鶯每次試圖抽動它，都會帶著上方眾多木塊一起移動。\n夜鶯和孩子都緊緊盯著那根木塊，絲毫沒有注意到閃靈與屋主同時站了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像把錢包掉在外面了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請幫我照顧我的同伴，我馬上就回來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，我們繼續。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她嘗試了許多次，期望整個木塔的重心能有所改變。\n但那根木塊依舊被壓得很緊。\n閃靈會怎麼做呢？她想了想。\n她記得閃靈會以肉眼看不清的速度抽走木塊，木塔甚至不會因此搖晃。\n她也準備嘗試一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加油哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜鶯深吸一口氣，抓住木塊，用力一抽——\n窗外晨曦般的光亮隨著木塔的倒下轉瞬即逝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶，我贏了！"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知道為什麼，明明贏的只有小女孩，她卻抓著夜鶯的手手舞足蹈起來，好像這場遊戲裡，她們兩個都是贏家一般。\n純粹真摯的情感讓夜鶯死寂的心泛起了一絲漣漪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你回來了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我都看到了，你一劍就……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你們也在逃嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"閃靈望向窗外，雨漸漸小了，黑夜很好地掩蓋了屍體。\n八個赦罪師衛兵，六個來路不明的刺客，兩撥不一樣的人，找上了同一間房子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以那另外六個人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"是來殺我和孩子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你願意留我們躲雨，也是因為這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"是……薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"時間很緊張，我請的護衛還沒到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是薩卡茲，那個自傲的貴族是不會僱用薩卡茲的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起來有幾分實力，所以我想……沒想到你們也……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，我可以理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，你幫了我一個大忙。如果你們不急著離開，可以在這裡休息一晚再走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，先生。我們也很想接受你的好意，但我們不能再耽擱一點時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你們路上不方便買口糧吧，我這裡還有點麵包和肉乾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……真的很感謝你，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我得謝謝你們，薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我女兒很久沒有那麼開心地和人玩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"她從小就這樣，對什麼人都沒有戒心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一直在逃，一直在搬家，躲著人住，她連和人打交道的機會都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這樣的日子馬上就要結束了，等那個傭兵過來，把她送去親戚那裡，她就能安定下來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不陪她嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那個該死的貴族殺了我妻子，害得我染病……等孩子安全了，我就要讓他付出代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會逃避的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雨停了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你提供我們避雨的地方，我想我們也該離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗茲，我們該走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經很晚了，姐姐們不留下來休息嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，有機會的話，下次再來陪你玩，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個送給你們！"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩把兩塊石頭一股腦塞進了閃靈手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我在河邊撿到的兩塊幸運石！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸運……石？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，把兩塊石頭敲一敲，就能變得幸運！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我上一次敲的時候，爸爸就帶回來一隻大羽獸，讓我好好吃了一頓呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定，以後姐姐們敲敲石頭，還能遇到我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望真的能有那麼一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"再見了，薩卡茲，後會有期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後會有期。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"來了嗎……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你好，艾德蒙先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，臨光小姐，請進吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這塊幸運石給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才還開心嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開心……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不太明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是覺得……很溫暖……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被他人重視，被他人關心……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能夠看著對方將手伸過來，握住它。而不是被刀劍指著……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果一直能有這樣的機會……開心……我想，我會開心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次，我們可以試著在村莊休息嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗茲……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是所有人都會用善意對待我們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是薩卡茲，你還有礦石病在身。在大多數人眼裡，我們是不受歡迎的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是因為那戶人家的主人恰巧也是一位感染者，我們或許連在屋簷下休息的機會都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但總是有機會的，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們偶爾能治癒別人的痛苦，那我想，偶爾，別人也會為我們行個方便的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使那個機率再小不過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信你，閃靈。你的真摯，你的懇切，總有人會回應的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當我們走過村莊，我會問村民；當我們遇上商隊，我會問商人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得做好受人白眼、遭人冷落的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果，運氣真在我們這邊，說不定，我們會遇到無私幫助我們的人；說不定，在不久的將來，我們能夠找到一個能安穩歇息的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"運氣的話，我們已經有了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜鶯拿出了閃靈交給自己的幸運石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，是啊。"},{"type":"narration","text":"閃靈也拿出了自己的那一塊。\n兩塊石頭撞到一起，發出了清脆的響聲。\n月光照耀下，幸運隨身的薩卡茲們離開了維多利亞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
